---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout'
---

<BaseLayout
    title='Privacy Policy'
    description='Privacy Policy for GetFOSS. We do not collect personal data, run ads, or use tracking. Learn what third-party services this site uses.'
>
    <article class='prose prose-lg md:prose-xl dark:prose-invert min-w-full py-4'>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p><em>Last updated: November 9, 2026</em></p>

        <h2>Overview</h2>
        <p>
            GetFOSS ("we", "us") operates www.getfoss.org, an independent blog about free and open-source
            software. This policy explains what information the site collects and how it is used. The short
            version: this site is a static blog — we do not require registration, do not sell data, do not
            run ads, and do not use analytics or tracking tools.
        </p>

        <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>
            You can read all articles without an account. We do not ask for your name, email address, or any
            other personal information, and we do not build user profiles.
        </p>

        <h2>Local Storage</h2>
        <p>
            The site stores small preferences (such as your dark or light theme choice) in your browser's
            local storage. This data never leaves your device, contains no personal information, and can be
            cleared at any time in your browser settings.
        </p>

        <h2>Hosting and Server Logs</h2>
        <p>
            The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. When you visit, GitHub, Inc. may automatically collect
            standard technical information such as your IP address, browser type, and requested pages, as
            described in the
            <a
                href='https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-privacy-statement'
                rel='noopener noreferrer'>GitHub Privacy Statement</a
            >. We do not control or process these logs.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>GetFOSS does not set advertising or tracking cookies.</p>

        <h2>Comments</h2>
        <p>
            Comments are not enabled on this site. If we add a commenting system in the future, it will be
            provided by a third-party service whose own privacy policy and cookies will apply, and this page
            will be updated before that happens.
        </p>

        <h2>External Links</h2>
        <p>
            Articles may link to third-party websites, such as official project pages or download sources.
            We are not responsible for the content or privacy practices of those sites. Please review their
            policies separately.
        </p>

        <h2>Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
            Because we do not collect or store personal data, there is generally nothing for us to access,
            correct, or delete. If you believe otherwise, or if you have questions about your rights under
            regulations such as the GDPR or CCPA, contact us at
            <a href='mailto:admin@getfoss.org'>admin@getfoss.org</a> and we will respond as soon as possible.
        </p>

        <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>
            The site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect personal
            information from children.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
            We may update this page from time to time. The "Last updated" date at the top shows the current
            version. Continued use of the site after changes means you accept the updated policy.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
            Questions about this policy: <a href='mailto:admin@getfoss.org'>admin@getfoss.org</a> or
            <a href='https://x.com/getfoss_org' rel='noopener noreferrer'>our X (Twitter)</a>.
        </p>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>
